# ---------- Private working notes (kept locally, never committed) ----------
# CLAUDE.md holds the AI assistant's working rules for this project. What's worth
# sharing from it is summarised in docs/DESIGN.md, section 12.
CLAUDE.md

# ---------- Data ----------
# Raw downloads (backend/data/raw/) can be re-created with `python -m app.data.fetch`,
# so we don't commit them. These ARE committed:
#   samples/   - small Phase 0 samples, to look at without running anything
#   processed/ - the clean data the app reads (small: well under 1 MB)
backend/data/*
!backend/data/samples/
!backend/data/processed/

# ---------- Vercel ----------
# Built React app copied into the backend at deploy time (backend/scripts/build_frontend.py)
backend/frontend_dist/
